-- k9 down: nothing to restore.
-- The podcast code is gone, so there is nothing that could read the tables k9
-- dropped; restore surreal_data from a backup if the rows are needed.
-- AsyncMigration.from_file() joins the statements of a file into one query, and
-- a file with no statement would send an empty string to SurrealDB, so this
-- keeps one inert statement.
RETURN NONE;
